<task id="102" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Implement ProvisioningHandlerDispatcher BackgroundService (ServiceBusSessionProcessor) in .Worker</title>
    <phase>C'' Wave G-1 -- Foundation</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Load-bearing execution-engine class per task instructions; modifies .cs in the L2 Worker project; concurrency-critical (session dispatch invariant). FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8 + this project's l2-controlplane rigor default.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Named explicitly in the parent task instructions as high-blast-radius (dispatcher class) -- Opus tier per root CLAUDE.md §8.5 escalation list. A single race condition here corrupts ProvisioningRun state for every customer.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
